|[[wikipedia:Dvořák|Antonín Léopold Dvořák]] (Czech composer)
|Not only is Dark Dober a musician, its Japanese name, Doveru Dāku (ドヴェルダーク, "Dover Dark"), is similar to ''Dovoruzāku'' (ドヴォルザーク), the Japanese pronunciation of Dvořák.
